+ * @run main/othervm -Xms128m -Xmx128m
+ *                   -XX:TrimNativeHeapInterval=300000
+ *                   TestTrimNativeHeapIntervalTablesCleanup string
+ * @run main/othervm -Xms128m -Xmx128m
+ *                   -XX:TrimNativeHeapInterval=300000
